          "macro": "dialogue",
          "params": {
            "lines": [
              [
                "baba",
                "Long ago, the Gloom Horn was not a horn at all.",
                "happy"
              ],
              [
                "baba",
                "It was a golden bamboo flute. The Banyan Flute.",
                "happy"
              ],
              [
                "baba",
                "Every monsoon, it played the valley's song, and the Rainbow Banyan grew strong.",
                "happy"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "legend_8",
          "at": {
            "after": "legend_7"
          },
          "macro": "dialogue",
          "params": {
            "lines": [
              [
                "mooka",
                "Then what happened?",
                "surprised"
              ],
              [
                "baba",
                "A little whisper crept inside it. The Hush.",
                "sad"
              ],
              [
                "baba",
                "It is not wicked, children. It is hungry. Hungry for big feelings nobody listens to.",
                "sad"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "legend_9",
          "at": {
            "after": "legend_8"
          },
          "macro": "dialogue",
          "params": {
            "lines": [
              [
                "baba",
                "It ate the flute's song from the inside, and the flute turned grey and twisted.",
                "sad"
              ],
              [
                "dony",
                "Into the Gloom Horn!",
                "scared"
              ],
              [
                "baba",
                "Into the Gloom Horn.",
                "sad"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
